"health_atlas_cell_play_basophil_0_caption" = "An activating signal reaches the basophil. This example illustrates one local inflammatory response.";
"health_atlas_cell_play_basophil_1_caption" = "Secretory granules prepare to release their contents at the membrane.";
"health_atlas_cell_play_basophil_2_caption" = "Histamine and other mediators enter the surrounding space.";
"health_atlas_cell_play_basophil_3_caption" = "The released messengers can change how nearby blood vessels respond.";
"health_atlas_cell_play_dendritic_0_caption" = "A dendritic cell takes up a small amount of material from its surroundings.";
"health_atlas_cell_play_dendritic_1_caption" = "Protein in the material is processed into smaller fragments.";
"health_atlas_cell_play_dendritic_2_caption" = "The cell shows a fragment on its surface so a matching T cell can recognize it.";
"health_atlas_cell_play_dendritic_3_caption" = "In lymphoid tissue, additional signals can help a matching T cell become activated.";
"health_atlas_cell_play_eosinophil_0_caption" = "Immune signals recruit eosinophils into the affected tissue.";
"health_atlas_cell_play_eosinophil_1_caption" = "An eosinophil can approach and interact with a target in the tissue.";
"health_atlas_cell_play_eosinophil_2_caption" = "Some granule contents are released outside the cell near the target.";
"health_atlas_cell_play_eosinophil_3_caption" = "The released contents can damage a susceptible target in this teaching example.";
"health_atlas_cell_play_macrophage_0_caption" = "The macrophage recognizes material in its surroundings that it can take up.";
"health_atlas_cell_play_macrophage_1_caption" = "Its membrane extends around the material and encloses it in a compartment inside the cell.";
"health_atlas_cell_play_macrophage_2_caption" = "The compartment joins structures containing digestive enzymes, which break down the material.";
"health_atlas_cell_play_macrophage_3_caption" = "The cell clears or recycles parts of the material and can send signals to surrounding cells.";
"health_atlas_cell_play_megakaryocyte_0_caption" = "In the bone marrow, a precursor matures into a megakaryocyte.";
"health_atlas_cell_play_megakaryocyte_1_caption" = "As the cell matures its cytoplasm expands and provides material for platelets.";
"health_atlas_cell_play_megakaryocyte_2_caption" = "Parts of the cytoplasm form extensions that can reach the circulation.";
"health_atlas_cell_play_megakaryocyte_3_caption" = "Fragments from these extensions become platelets. A platelet is a cell fragment, not a whole cell.";
