"health_atlas_pleura_story_layers" = "Two layers and a thin fluid film";
"health_atlas_pleura_story_layers_caption" = "Parietal pleura lines the inside of the chest wall and covers the upper surface of the diaphragm. Visceral pleura covers the lung. A thin film of fluid lies in the narrow space between them.";
